			description: [
				"summon a &6foliot&r spirit -- occultism's lowest-tier helper. this quest tracks the &blumberjack&r ritual specifically; you can also bind a foliot to &bcleaner&r or &bitem transport&r duty afterward, but summon a lumberjack first to clear this quest."
				""
				"costs a fire charge. cheap, and it's required -- the apprentice tier assumes you have logistics help."
